/* ── Element spec ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   uv u-axis / v-axis      → CylinderGeometry shaft + ConeGeometry head, black
   u-constant line (uv)    → BoxGeometry(0.075, 2.3, 0.012)  orange #F0A030
   v-constant line (uv)    → BoxGeometry(3.2, 0.075, 0.012)  purple #B0539E
   uv intersection dot     → SphereGeometry(0.06) black
   mapping block arrow     → ShapeGeometry(arc band + head) #FBE3B4 + LineLoop #9A9A9A
   xyz axes (x,y,z)        → CylinderGeometry shaft + ConeGeometry head, black
   surface patch           → BufferGeometry 40x40 parametric mesh, MeshLambert #CCCCCC
   coordinate grid curves  → TubeGeometry r=0.012, #7A7A7A (5 u-curves + 5 v-curves)
   constant-u curve        → TubeGeometry r=0.035 orange #F0A030
   constant-v curve        → TubeGeometry r=0.035 purple #B0539E
